{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Gysin同态"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Gysin 同态”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>微分几何</h2>\n<p>设 $X, Y$ 为紧连通微分流形, 若映射 $f \\colon X \\to Y$ 满足\n$$\r\nc_1(f) \\equiv  w_2(Y) -f^* w_2(X) \\mod 2\r\n$$\n其中 $w_2$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Stiefel--Whitney类","text":"Stiefel–Whitney 类"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n"}]}}